  "problem": "Ann has three email accounts. In the first account, she receives $40%$ of her emails, of which $10%$ are spam. In the second account, she receives $35%$ of her emails, of which $8%$ are spam. And in the third account, she receives $25%$ of her emails, of which $8%$ are spam. Based on this data, what is the probability that a randomly selected email from any of Ann's accounts is spam?",
